      "writtenOn": "2025-03-05T15:42:07Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes, whenever Vulkan can not read from the dst as input for whatever reason (which right now can occur w/ MSAA textures, and for textures that do not support input attachment usage). We expect the latter to always be true for android but not necessarily other platforms at this point in time. In those cases, we still use dst copies. See `VulkanCaps::getDstReadStrategy(...)` for that logic.",
      "parentUuid": "f88a59a4_9b3e8299",
